  - 'Thank you, adventurer! '
  - Now we can come back and live in our world again! I know that you want to continue
    your adventure and maybe help others too. Here, I'll create a platform that will
    help you reach other worlds!
  - 'You have to jump on it in order to enter those worlds!

    Good luck, adventurer!'
  - 
